WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.738
The golden circle has three rings.

00:00:02.788 --> 00:00:04.424
Why is your purpose.

00:00:04.474 --> 00:00:06.971
How is the distinctive way you deliver it.

00:00:07.021 --> 00:00:09.226
What is the stuff you sell.

00:00:09.933 --> 00:00:13.916
Most companies start outside in: here's our computer, it's fast.

00:00:13.966 --> 00:00:15.378
Apple starts with why:

00:00:15.428 --> 00:00:16.888
we challenge the status quo,

00:00:16.938 --> 00:00:19.163
and we happen to make computers.

00:00:19.867 --> 00:00:21.739
People buy into beliefs.

00:00:21.789 --> 00:00:24.392
But the why must be genuine and backed by proof,

00:00:24.442 --> 00:00:26.529
or it's just empty words.

00:00:27.233 --> 00:00:28.362
Use it like this:

00:00:28.412 --> 00:00:29.589
write the brand's why,

00:00:29.639 --> 00:00:31.534
how and what in one line each,

00:00:31.584 --> 00:00:34.055
then check the why has proof.
